            $k('Pages load slowly in the morning', 'slow morning, slow start of day, slow when many users, busy time slow, morning slow', 'Many people sign in at the same time at the start of the shift. Wait a few seconds per action and avoid repeated clicks. If it is slow all day, tell an administrator.'),
            $k('A page loads half and stops', 'page loads half, stops loading, partial page, incomplete page, spinner forever, loading stops', 'Reload with Ctrl + F5. If it keeps happening on the same page, tell an administrator the page and time; the server log shows what stopped.'),
            $k('The loading spinner never stops', 'spinner never stops, endless loading, loading forever, stuck spinner, loading panel stays', 'Wait up to a minute (InterLink views can take 5 to 6 seconds, longer when InterLink is slow), then reload with Ctrl + F5. The loading panel clears itself after 30 seconds.', [], $il),
