            $k('How do I register the background worker task?', 'register worker, scheduled task register, install worker, start worker task, interlink worker task', 'On the server open PowerShell as administrator and run: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File D:\\html\\NEXUS-L\\tools\\interlink-worker.ps1. It runs every minute: InterLink reading, queue and the Brain export.', [], $adm + ['diagnose' => 'worker']),
            $k('How do I check what the worker did?', 'worker log, what worker did, worker result, check worker output, worker run result', 'Brain > Health shows whether it runs; run php spark interlink:work in D:\\html\\NEXUS-L to see one cycle printed (session state, changes, jobs).', [], $adm + ['diagnose' => 'worker']),
            $k('How do I move NEXUS-L to the SSD?', 'move to ssd, move project c drive, relocate d drive, move off d, faster disk move', 'Stop Apache, copy the whole project folder to the SSD, point Apache\'s alias and .env to the new folder, run php spark deploy:check, and keep the old folder until you have verified everything.', [], $adm),
            $k('How do I change the Brain folder locations?', 'change brain folder, brain path, move brain, brain location setting, mirror folder change', 'The Brain folders are D:\\html\\Brain and the mirror C:\\Brain. To use other folders an administrator stores a list of paths in the app setting "brain_dirs"; Brain > Health shows the active ones.', [], $adm + ['diagnose' => 'brain']),
            $k('How do I see all reports synced by a person?', 'synced by person, sync by user, who synced, sync audit, user sync list', 'InterLink Sync > Sync History lists each sync with the user, application, report number, mode and time.', [], $adm + ['page_match' => 'interlink']),
