            $k('What are the system requirements for my computer?', 'computer requirements, pc requirements, minimum requirements, what pc needed, specs needed', 'Any computer on the lab network with a current Chrome or Edge, and a screen of 1366 px width or more for data entry. Nothing needs to be installed.'),
